The AppImage start-up stub: github.com/AppImage/type2-runtime (MIT, see its LICENSE) at the commit named in
tools/build_appimage_runtime.sh, with two changes: it unpacks and runs where it cannot mount, and its
libfuse build skips the device nodes an unprivileged (rootless) container may not create.

